WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 32=

5
01:51.340 --> 01:57.460
♪A daughter ventures forth, in the name her father gave♪

6
01:57.820 --> 02:03.980
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

7
02:05.460 --> 02:11.620
♪The fate is sealed, a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

8
02:12.140 --> 02:15.680
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

9
02:15.680 --> 02:19.340
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

10
02:19.940 --> 02:23.640
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

11
02:23.640 --> 02:27.060
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

12
02:27.180 --> 02:30.660
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

13
02:30.660 --> 02:34.300
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

14
02:34.780 --> 02:38.780
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

15
02:38.860 --> 02:41.380
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

16
02:41.540 --> 02:45.020
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

17
02:45.380 --> 02:48.900
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

18
02:48.980 --> 02:53.180
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

19
02:53.300 --> 02:55.820
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

20
02:55.900 --> 02:59.020
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

21
02:59.140 --> 03:02.260
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

22
03:02.940 --> 03:06.980
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

23
03:07.500 --> 03:10.300
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

24
03:10.340 --> 03:16.580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

25
03:17.220 --> 03:21.020
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

26
03:21.740 --> 03:24.540
(Your Highness, the wedding procession will follow Huai's traditional rites.)

27
03:24.820 --> 03:26.540
(The wedding reception will follow North Jing's customs.)

28
03:27.180 --> 03:28.460
(The Military Governor has had)

29
03:28.660 --> 03:30.860
(a wedding tent set up outside the eastern city gate.)

30
03:31.460 --> 03:33.660
(Already rehearsed the ceremony with the Ministry of Rites.)

31
03:35.580 --> 03:39.380
Your Highness, please step into the royal carriage!

32
03:42.020 --> 03:46.120
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

33
03:46.120 --> 03:50.460
♪A scar for a scar♪

34
03:51.260 --> 03:54.700
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

35
03:55.420 --> 03:56.340
The most foolish,

36
03:58.620 --> 03:59.500
most malicious,

37
04:02.380 --> 04:04.100
and most arrogant

38
04:05.260 --> 04:07.380
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

39
04:07.380 --> 04:08.860
of sinners, Yan Shang,

40
04:09.060 --> 04:12.820
♪They gave me this life without asking me♪

41
04:13.300 --> 04:16.380
♪If I can't decide what to do with it♪

42
04:16.380 --> 04:19.320
♪I might as well use it to light a fire♪

43
04:20.100 --> 04:21.580
bids you farewell, Your Highness.

44
04:23.340 --> 04:27.140
♪You're my princess, and I'll take you away♪

45
04:27.260 --> 04:30.340
♪In this life, we'll bow only to flowers♪

46
04:30.580 --> 04:36.420
♪Fierce and radiant, red lips and dark eyes♪

47
04:36.700 --> 04:40.740
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

48
05:47.660 --> 05:49.700
Bring out the bride!

49
05:49.860 --> 05:51.860
Bring out the bride!

50
06:17.100 --> 06:17.860
No, Your Highness!

51
06:35.180 --> 06:35.700
Let go of me!

52
06:51.300 --> 06:51.860
Mu Wanyao.

53
06:52.900 --> 06:53.780
You don't want to marry me,

54
06:54.620 --> 06:55.620
but I want to marry you.

55
06:56.820 --> 06:58.220
At least we have one thing in common.

56
07:00.100 --> 07:01.340
You don't want to be trapped in the palace.

57
07:02.700 --> 07:03.260
Neither do I.

58
07:05.620 --> 07:06.180
What are you doing?

59
07:42.380 --> 07:44.100
Run! Hurry!

60
08:03.820 --> 08:04.260
Stop!

61
08:04.620 --> 08:05.140
Stop!

62
08:08.060 --> 08:09.100
Don't run! Stop!

63
08:18.580 --> 08:19.220
I'll handle the reins.

64
08:19.460 --> 08:20.180
You deal with the pursuers!

65
08:28.660 --> 08:29.020
After them!

66
08:29.220 --> 08:29.700
After them!

67
08:36.500 --> 08:37.420
Finally willing to come back with me

68
08:38.100 --> 08:39.100
and be my wife?

69
08:39.620 --> 08:41.300
This is no time for your smart mouth!

70
08:44.940 --> 08:45.740
They're right on our heels.

71
08:46.260 --> 08:46.980
Keep heading west.

72
08:47.660 --> 08:48.500
I've got another group waiting

73
08:49.180 --> 08:50.300
in the woods 50 li ahead.

74
09:11.460 --> 09:12.220
Look ahead.

75
09:16.660 --> 09:17.260
Watch the road.

76
09:18.260 --> 09:18.860
Don't look back.

77
09:39.060 --> 09:39.500
Hang in there.

78
09:39.860 --> 09:40.740
I'll stop the bleeding.

79
09:42.780 --> 09:43.620
I'll take you back to North Jing.

80
09:48.700 --> 09:49.580
Back then,

81
09:53.380 --> 09:55.540
I should never have let you leave North Jing.

82
09:57.940 --> 09:58.860
I should've

83
10:00.180 --> 10:01.500
kept you locked up

84
10:03.660 --> 10:04.620
and tied down.

85
10:05.500 --> 10:05.940
Shut up.

86
10:08.260 --> 10:09.940
Tonight was supposed to be

87
10:11.340 --> 10:13.060
our wedding night.

88
10:33.540 --> 10:35.340
We've been through the wedding tent.

89
10:39.060 --> 10:40.060
Mu Wanyao.

90
10:46.060 --> 10:47.900
You're my woman now.

91
10:52.620 --> 10:53.500
Don't make me slap you.

92
10:57.540 --> 10:59.060
Never thought I'd see the day

93
11:04.500 --> 11:06.420
you'd cry for me.

94
11:07.340 --> 11:07.900
Take this.

95
11:09.580 --> 11:11.620
It's what you like.

96
11:28.300 --> 11:28.900
- General! - General!

97
11:31.220 --> 11:32.060
They

98
11:33.820 --> 11:35.460
have all received my orders.

99
11:37.820 --> 11:39.620
No matter what happens tonight,

100
11:41.980 --> 11:43.260
they'll see you safely

101
11:44.460 --> 11:45.420
all the way north.

102
11:46.820 --> 11:47.420
What about you?

103
11:56.700 --> 11:58.100
Haven't you always wanted

104
11:59.900 --> 12:01.500
freedom?

105
12:07.340 --> 12:08.660
Everyone wants it.

106
12:11.460 --> 12:13.540
It's worth more than gold.

107
12:15.300 --> 12:17.100
More precious than life itself.

108
12:21.980 --> 12:22.700
Go.

109
12:24.380 --> 12:25.060
It's...

110
12:29.820 --> 12:32.660
just up ahead.

111
12:39.380 --> 12:40.660
General!

112
12:56.060 --> 12:57.420
Did you two see clearly?

113
12:57.900 --> 13:00.300
Was it really Meng Zaishi who got hit?

114
13:00.860 --> 13:03.100
General Meng was shot through the heart by someone from the Shence Army.

115
13:03.300 --> 13:04.100
You fools!

116
13:05.700 --> 13:08.220
How dare you kill him!

117
13:10.940 --> 13:11.420
We're done for.

118
13:12.460 --> 13:12.940
We're finished.

119
13:14.300 --> 13:16.380
You could have at least let him escape.

120
13:17.220 --> 13:20.020
Even... even if you'd hit Wanyao by mistake.

121
13:23.260 --> 13:23.780
We're done for.

122
13:25.860 --> 13:27.940
As long as Meng Zaishi stayed in the palace,

123
13:27.940 --> 13:30.180
Huai would remain safe.

124
13:31.060 --> 13:32.420
But now he's dead in Sheng'an.

125
13:33.260 --> 13:34.660
Once word reaches North Jing,

126
13:34.980 --> 13:36.820
they'll surely rise in rebellion.

127
13:37.420 --> 13:38.060
What do we do?

128
13:39.660 --> 13:40.340
How do we stop them?

129
13:41.580 --> 13:43.260
With your own heads?

130
13:43.860 --> 13:44.940
- We deserve death! - We deserve death!

131
13:54.260 --> 13:55.700
Was Wanyao with him?

132
13:57.540 --> 13:57.940
Yes.

133
13:59.260 --> 14:01.340
I've already sent more men to seal off and pursue.

134
14:01.540 --> 14:02.180
We'll bring back

135
14:02.460 --> 14:04.540
Princess Danyang and Meng Zaishi's body, Your Majesty.

136
14:04.700 --> 14:06.220
You idiot!

137
14:09.460 --> 14:09.820
Your Majesty.

138
14:10.380 --> 14:11.180
- Your Majesty! - Your Majesty.

139
14:12.100 --> 14:13.140
- I'll personally lead the cavalry - Your Majesty.

140
14:13.340 --> 14:14.260
after the people of North Jing now!

141
14:15.020 --> 14:15.460
Come back!

142
14:18.380 --> 14:20.220
Haven't you two caused enough trouble?

143
14:21.380 --> 14:22.940
Recall your men at once!

144
14:24.220 --> 14:25.060
Listen carefully, both of you.

145
14:25.500 --> 14:26.540
General Meng was treated with great honor

146
14:26.860 --> 14:27.700
in Sheng'an.

147
14:28.140 --> 14:29.100
He died by accident.

148
14:29.580 --> 14:31.820
The court will prepare generous funeral funds.

149
14:32.380 --> 14:32.740
You two

150
14:33.180 --> 14:34.820
take His Majesty's personal letter of condolence

151
14:35.020 --> 14:36.700
and ride to North Jing at once to mourn!

152
14:37.420 --> 14:37.780
And

153
14:38.500 --> 14:40.100
tie up your subordinate

154
14:40.580 --> 14:41.020
who shot the arrow

155
14:41.740 --> 14:42.380
and bring him along.

156
14:43.580 --> 14:43.860
Yes.

157
14:43.940 --> 14:44.220
Yes.

158
14:45.820 --> 14:47.140
Summon the Director of the Imperial Medical Office!

159
14:47.820 --> 14:48.100
Yes.

160
14:48.180 --> 14:48.460
Yes.

161
14:50.540 --> 14:50.900
Your Majesty.

162
14:51.820 --> 14:52.180
Your Majesty.

163
14:53.540 --> 14:53.940
Your Majesty!

164
14:55.180 --> 14:55.740
Your Majesty!

165
14:56.700 --> 14:57.220
Your Majesty!

166
14:59.100 --> 15:05.750
(Ganlu Hall)

167
15:06.620 --> 15:07.340
Guards.

168
15:11.060 --> 15:11.420
Yes!

169
15:11.540 --> 15:12.860
His Majesty is ill.

170
15:13.300 --> 15:14.820
He must not be disturbed.

171
15:16.020 --> 15:16.820
From this moment on,

172
15:17.500 --> 15:20.180
all imperial physicians will rotate on duty inside.

173
15:21.020 --> 15:21.620
Guard

174
15:22.220 --> 15:23.500
the chamber strictly.

175
15:24.620 --> 15:25.540
Without my order,

176
15:26.340 --> 15:27.140
not a single scrap of paper

177
15:27.700 --> 15:28.620
goes in or out.

178
15:30.020 --> 15:31.220
The Jinwu Guard are to redeploy

179
15:31.740 --> 15:32.900
and seal the nine gates of the imperial city.

180
15:33.460 --> 15:35.540
Ten thousand men each from Hanbei, Hannan, and Handong prefectures.

181
15:35.980 --> 15:37.396
(With Bold, Majestic Strides) Prepare for battle at Tongguan

182
15:37.396 --> 15:38.340
(With Bold, Majestic Strides) in three days!

183
15:39.020 --> 15:40.860
No one is to delay!

184
15:41.740 --> 15:42.300
(Guanghua Gate) Yes!

185
15:44.620 --> 15:45.780
(Shence Army)

186
16:21.380 --> 16:23.980
She's now heading north with Meng Zaishi's body.

187
16:24.500 --> 16:25.380
The court doesn't dare stop her.

188
16:26.020 --> 16:27.100
Gates open all along the way,

189
16:27.220 --> 16:28.100
prefectural officials greeting her,

190
16:28.300 --> 16:29.060
mourning rites all along the route.

191
16:29.820 --> 16:31.260
Terrified they can't explain themselves to North Jing.

192
16:32.660 --> 16:33.980
So don't worry about her for now.

193
16:43.140 --> 16:43.540
Also,

194
16:45.700 --> 16:46.780
things have been strange in the palace.

195
16:47.740 --> 16:49.300
I heard several imperial physicians

196
16:49.860 --> 16:50.980
and the Director of the Imperial Medical Office

197
16:51.860 --> 16:52.980
have suddenly vanished.

198
17:03.860 --> 17:04.380
Thanks.

199
17:06.580 --> 17:06.980
I'm leaving.

200
17:08.020 --> 17:08.700
Take care of yourself.

201
18:25.180 --> 18:26.060
March on Sheng'an

202
18:26.980 --> 18:28.140
and take the Emperor's head!

203
18:28.980 --> 18:29.940
Water our horses in the Wei River!

204
18:30.180 --> 18:31.500
Avenge General Meng!

205
18:31.500 --> 18:32.860
Avenge General Meng!

206
18:32.860 --> 18:37.800
Avenge General Meng!

207
18:37.800 --> 18:42.860
Avenge General Meng!

208
18:43.060 --> 18:44.820
Avenge General Meng!

209
18:44.820 --> 18:45.900
Meng Zaishi has just died,

210
18:47.060 --> 18:48.020
and his body is still there.

211
18:48.740 --> 18:50.180
And you've already forgotten

212
18:50.460 --> 18:51.260
everything he taught you?

213
18:53.300 --> 18:54.220
I want revenge too.

214
18:54.900 --> 18:55.540
But I know

215
18:55.900 --> 18:57.140
what kind of man Meng Zaishi was!

216
18:58.860 --> 19:00.180
He cared more about your lives

217
19:01.300 --> 19:02.700
than his own!

218
19:18.460 --> 19:19.620
(North Jing Military Tally) Don't let your general down.

219
19:20.940 --> 19:22.180
Don't let him die for nothing!

220
19:36.980 --> 19:37.580
Your Highness,

221
19:38.020 --> 19:39.340
we await your command!

222
19:40.460 --> 19:42.980
Your Highness, we await your command!

223
19:45.980 --> 19:50.740
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

224
19:50.980 --> 19:53.460
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

225
19:53.660 --> 19:56.820
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

226
19:57.140 --> 20:00.620
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

227
20:01.220 --> 20:02.460
Have the three armies assembled at the border

228
20:02.900 --> 20:03.620
to see me off.

229
20:04.500 --> 20:05.580
What are you planning to do?

230
20:06.780 --> 20:07.580
I'm going back

231
20:08.300 --> 20:09.380
to get justice

232
20:09.860 --> 20:10.780
for General Meng.

233
20:10.940 --> 20:14.020
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

234
20:14.540 --> 20:18.540
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

235
20:19.100 --> 20:21.860
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

236
20:21.940 --> 20:28.140
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

237
20:28.780 --> 20:32.580
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

238
20:32.700 --> 20:35.780
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

239
20:36.060 --> 20:39.820
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

240
20:39.980 --> 20:44.100
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

241
20:44.100 --> 20:48.420
♪A scar for a scar♪

242
20:48.980 --> 20:52.340
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

243
20:53.620 --> 20:57.820
♪Mourn the blooms of youth♪

244
20:57.820 --> 21:02.100
♪Mourn my bridal hair♪

245
21:02.820 --> 21:06.020
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

246
21:08.140 --> 21:08.620
The Seven Governors.

247
21:09.260 --> 21:09.860
The Seven Governors...

248
21:10.300 --> 21:10.700
Someone...

249
21:11.100 --> 21:11.860
Someone, protect...

250
21:12.300 --> 21:13.260
Protect me...

251
21:13.660 --> 21:14.140
- Your Majesty. - Protect...

252
21:14.420 --> 21:14.740
Hurry.

253
21:14.820 --> 21:15.140
Your Majesty.

254
21:15.140 --> 21:15.580
Hurry. Protect...

255
21:16.980 --> 21:17.340
Use the needles.

256
21:17.420 --> 21:17.740
Hurry.

257
21:18.060 --> 21:18.580
Hurry...

258
21:18.860 --> 21:19.620
Hurry up...

259
21:20.060 --> 21:20.900
Hurry, protect me.

260
21:21.260 --> 21:21.660
The Seven Governors...

261
21:25.660 --> 21:26.180
Your Majesty.

262
21:27.220 --> 21:27.860
Your Majesty.

263
21:32.540 --> 21:34.540
So it was... just a dream.

264
21:37.180 --> 21:37.740
Your Majesty.

265
21:38.220 --> 21:41.100
Princess Danyang has returned from North Jing.

266
21:46.500 --> 21:47.700
She is back?

267
21:49.260 --> 21:51.500
She holds North Jing's military tally.

268
21:52.380 --> 21:54.820
North Jing's troops are massing at the border.

269
21:57.020 --> 21:58.540
If she dares return now,

270
21:58.980 --> 22:00.380
she must have a plan.

271
22:01.340 --> 22:04.260
This won't end peacefully.

272
22:11.700 --> 22:13.500
North Jing's troops?

273
22:31.780 --> 22:32.260
(Sheng'an)

274
22:33.060 --> 22:33.860
(I am)

275
22:34.540 --> 22:35.260
(back.)

276
22:40.940 --> 22:41.460
Your Majesty.

277
22:42.300 --> 22:43.420
Princess Danyang is here.

278
22:46.980 --> 22:47.700
Show her in.

279
23:09.860 --> 23:10.340
Father.

280
23:12.620 --> 23:13.260
I'm back.

281
23:16.060 --> 23:16.580
You...

282
23:18.740 --> 23:20.700
This outfit is from North Jing.

283
23:21.860 --> 23:23.260
The wedding dress you gave me

284
23:23.860 --> 23:25.860
was soaked through with Meng Zaishi's blood.

285
23:27.140 --> 23:27.820
Can't wear it anymore.

286
23:34.500 --> 23:35.780
My condolences, Your Highness.

287
23:36.860 --> 23:37.580
You may not know,

288
23:38.540 --> 23:39.300
but the sight of his body

289
23:39.900 --> 23:40.980
filled the generals

290
23:41.900 --> 23:42.820
with grief and rage.

291
23:43.820 --> 23:44.780
A hundred thousand men.

292
23:45.660 --> 23:48.180
I'd never heard such earth-shattering cries of grief.

293
23:50.700 --> 23:51.140
That...

294
23:52.380 --> 23:54.220
That army of a hundred thousand...

295
23:54.900 --> 23:56.260
You mean North Jing's army?

296
23:58.740 --> 24:00.180
They wailed at the funeral,

297
24:00.900 --> 24:03.300
cutting their faces and weeping blood for Meng Zaishi.

298
24:04.220 --> 24:06.620
They swore to avenge their general.

299
24:10.580 --> 24:12.380
You dare threaten me?

300
24:14.260 --> 24:15.140
You actually

301
24:15.780 --> 24:17.100
colluded with North Jing?

302
24:17.460 --> 24:18.060
Colluded?

303
24:19.260 --> 24:20.060
What are you talking about?

304
24:21.540 --> 24:23.020
North Jing is Huai's territory.

305
24:23.380 --> 24:24.300
How is that collusion?

306
24:25.140 --> 24:25.860
Meng Zaishi

307
24:26.220 --> 24:27.740
was Huai's border general.

308
24:28.220 --> 24:29.380
His death remains unexplained.

309
24:29.980 --> 24:32.020
Shouldn't the court mourn him?

310
24:33.220 --> 24:34.260
Back during the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors,

311
24:35.220 --> 24:36.100
if North Jing

312
24:36.660 --> 24:37.980
hadn't been the first to withdraw its troops,

313
24:39.180 --> 24:41.380
who knows how many more years the war would've dragged on?

314
24:42.260 --> 24:43.580
Isn't that the Meng family's merit?

315
24:45.100 --> 24:45.580
Father.

316
24:46.540 --> 24:47.740
Is Taiji Palace

317
24:48.580 --> 24:51.140
and that throne all you care about?

318
24:52.740 --> 24:54.380
Your Highness, you don't know this,

319
24:55.460 --> 24:56.740
but when you left the capital,

320
24:57.100 --> 24:59.260
His Majesty was shocked by the news.

321
24:59.940 --> 25:02.740
He was so worried about your safety

322
25:03.460 --> 25:04.180
that he suffered

323
25:04.780 --> 25:06.020
a stroke from the anxiety.

324
25:08.580 --> 25:09.500
So

325
25:09.980 --> 25:11.620
you fell ill out of worry for me, Father.

326
25:13.340 --> 25:15.860
I thought it was from wrongfully killing Meng Zaishi by mistake.

327
25:17.620 --> 25:18.820
It seems the generals of North Jing

328
25:19.420 --> 25:20.380
have misunderstood you.

329
25:25.660 --> 25:26.380
You actually...

330
25:27.340 --> 25:29.700
You actually dare incite the vassal troops?

331
25:30.180 --> 25:30.660
Father,

332
25:31.980 --> 25:33.220
do you think I dared to come back

333
25:34.220 --> 25:36.740
because I have North Jing's troops?

334
25:38.260 --> 25:40.500
Do you think I'd use the lives of those soldiers

335
25:40.820 --> 25:42.980
and the people of Huai to threaten you?

336
25:49.700 --> 25:50.100
Look.

337
25:51.820 --> 25:53.140
This is Meng Zaishi's wolf tally.

338
25:54.380 --> 25:55.020
With it,

339
25:55.940 --> 25:57.700
(North Jing Military Tally) I can command their three armies.

340
26:03.180 --> 26:04.900
Your Highness, please don't act rashly.

341
26:13.900 --> 26:14.420
Speak.

342
26:16.340 --> 26:17.180
What exactly

343
26:17.780 --> 26:18.700
do you want?

344
26:20.660 --> 26:21.180
Father,

345
26:22.340 --> 26:22.980
I'm not like you.

346
26:25.020 --> 26:26.620
I'm not good at using people as pawns.

347
26:27.660 --> 26:29.940
And I don't want to gamble the fate of the realm on some grand scheme.

348
26:31.540 --> 26:32.620
I don't have

349
26:32.940 --> 26:34.300
your ruthless heart.

350
26:35.340 --> 26:36.980
I don't enjoy throwing away people's lives

351
26:37.740 --> 26:38.940
or trampling on their dignity.

352
26:40.260 --> 26:40.940
I came back

353
26:41.940 --> 26:42.780
only because

354
26:43.340 --> 26:45.100
Sheng'an is my home.

355
26:48.260 --> 26:49.180
Even if I say all this,

356
26:49.740 --> 26:50.740
you won't believe me.

357
27:01.780 --> 27:02.340
Father.

358
27:04.260 --> 27:06.140
Do you remember that prophecy?

359
27:07.380 --> 27:08.420
The daughter of the Yaoguang Star

360
27:08.980 --> 27:09.940
shall restore the imperial house.

361
27:11.700 --> 27:14.540
When you had the court historians write that prophecy down,

362
27:15.140 --> 27:16.180
you probably never thought

363
27:16.900 --> 27:18.780
it'd come true one day, did you?

364
27:20.300 --> 27:21.380
I suppose I have you to thank for that.

365
27:22.940 --> 27:25.660
All the suffering, grief, and bloodshed I've endured

366
27:26.340 --> 27:27.340
throughout my life...

367
27:28.700 --> 27:30.540
All thanks to that prophecy of yours.

368
27:33.540 --> 27:34.060
You...

369
27:35.020 --> 27:35.580
You...

370
27:36.460 --> 27:37.020
You...

371
27:38.340 --> 27:39.220
You mean...

372
27:41.100 --> 27:41.500
You...

373
27:44.540 --> 27:44.780
Your...

374
27:48.900 --> 27:50.220
You rebellious daughter!

375
27:52.740 --> 27:53.420
Rebellious daughter.

376
28:07.500 --> 28:08.820
That's quite a joke, Father.

377
28:09.700 --> 28:10.940
There have only ever been rebellious sons.

378
28:11.740 --> 28:13.500
How could a daughter ever be rebellious?

379
28:14.460 --> 28:15.060
Tell me,

380
28:16.140 --> 28:16.860
what exactly

381
28:18.660 --> 28:20.300
do you want?

382
28:20.820 --> 28:21.820
What do I want?

383
28:25.460 --> 28:27.660
If only you'd asked me that

384
28:28.780 --> 28:29.780
sooner.

385
28:35.860 --> 28:36.460
Father,

386
28:37.780 --> 28:38.500
look at you now.

387
28:39.660 --> 28:40.260
Who else but me

388
28:40.860 --> 28:41.980
would take care of you?

389
28:43.700 --> 28:44.940
Are you counting on your sons?

390
28:45.620 --> 28:46.220
The Crown Prince?

391
28:48.500 --> 28:50.380
If I sent you to them,

392
28:52.260 --> 28:53.260
none of them

393
28:54.260 --> 28:57.140
would let you lie here and breathe another day.

394
29:03.180 --> 29:05.900
Your Highness, I'm deeply moved

395
29:06.260 --> 29:07.380
by your filial devotion.

396
29:08.380 --> 29:09.860
His Majesty is unwell.

397
29:10.740 --> 29:12.980
Your Highness, why not tell us plainly

398
29:13.460 --> 29:15.220
what you intend to do?

399
29:17.260 --> 29:18.500
State affairs take endless effort.

400
29:19.180 --> 29:20.460
They can't go a single day unattended.

401
29:24.740 --> 29:25.420
Now

402
29:26.660 --> 29:28.100
I'm the only one who can help you now.

403
29:30.220 --> 29:30.860
Huai

404
29:31.220 --> 29:34.060
has a precedent for a princess ruling as Regent.

405
29:35.580 --> 29:36.380
Besides,

406
29:37.140 --> 29:37.780
I'm

407
29:38.260 --> 29:39.620
only here to ease your burden, Father.

408
29:43.780 --> 29:44.420
What?

409
29:45.740 --> 29:46.180
You...

410
29:47.540 --> 29:48.140
How...

411
29:49.060 --> 29:50.500
How dare you!

412
29:58.020 --> 29:58.740
Your Majesty,

413
29:59.820 --> 30:01.380
you've been bedridden for days.

414
30:01.700 --> 30:05.020
I've managed to pacify the officials for now.

415
30:05.660 --> 30:08.500
But it's not a long-term solution.

416
30:09.380 --> 30:10.420
The Yu faction is barely settled.

417
30:11.060 --> 30:13.620
The Lingnan case implicates many.

418
30:14.020 --> 30:15.260
The court is in turmoil.

419
30:15.620 --> 30:17.580
North Jing is now without a ruler.

420
30:18.220 --> 30:19.420
And the Crown Prince has been deposed.

421
30:19.740 --> 30:20.780
With things as they are,

422
30:21.380 --> 30:23.300
placing Her Highness in charge

423
30:23.980 --> 30:25.980
is the way to secure Huai's stability.

424
30:28.100 --> 30:28.900
Chancellor Liu.

425
30:29.460 --> 30:29.820
How...

426
30:30.860 --> 30:32.420
How dare you betray me!

427
30:32.900 --> 30:34.140
- Someone! - Your Majesty!

428
30:34.380 --> 30:34.820
You...

429
30:35.500 --> 30:35.980
You all...

430
30:37.420 --> 30:38.540
- Your Majesty. - Someone.

431
30:39.100 --> 30:39.820
Your Majesty.

432
30:40.980 --> 30:43.540
- Your Majesty! - Someone!

433
30:43.540 --> 30:45.980
- Please serve as Regent, Your Highness! - Someone!

434
30:46.780 --> 30:49.780
There's still room to turn things around!

435
30:49.980 --> 30:51.300
Someone!

436
31:04.780 --> 31:07.740
(Huai)

437
31:13.300 --> 31:19.460
♪A daughter ventures forth, in the name her father gave♪

438
31:19.880 --> 31:22.480
♪Into savage lands♪

439
31:23.180 --> 31:25.980
His Majesty is unwell, and the realm faces difficult times.

440
31:26.300 --> 31:29.860
Princess Danyang is hereby elevated to Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm.

441
31:30.260 --> 31:31.420
She shall hold authority over military affairs.

442
31:32.100 --> 31:34.500
All matters under the Chancellery, Secretariat, Six Ministries,

443
31:34.660 --> 31:36.060
and other offices shall be decided by her.

444
31:37.220 --> 31:39.940
By decree, Meng Zaishi, Military Governor of North Jing,

445
31:40.260 --> 31:41.460
is honored for his unwavering loyalty

446
31:41.740 --> 31:42.980
and integrity.

447
31:43.340 --> 31:44.940
He is posthumously titled Duke of Jing,

448
31:45.260 --> 31:46.220
with the name Zhonglie.

449
31:46.620 --> 31:49.380
His armor shall be enshrined forever in Lingyan Pavilion.

450
31:50.220 --> 31:52.380
By decree, Pacification Commissioner Wei Shu

451
31:52.740 --> 31:54.020
is commended for his loyalty, courage,

452
31:54.260 --> 31:55.500
and steadfast resolve.

453
31:55.940 --> 31:57.380
He is granted the purple-gold fish pouch

454
31:57.700 --> 31:59.420
and appointed Grand Master of Splendid Happiness.

455
32:00.620 --> 32:02.260
By decree, Zhao Lingfei

456
32:02.500 --> 32:03.620
is promoted to Imperial Secretary,

457
32:03.980 --> 32:05.940
receiving the same emoluments as a Sixth-Rank Palace Lady

458
32:06.260 --> 32:08.340
and overseeing the titled ladies of the inner and outer courts

459
32:08.340 --> 32:10.900
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

460
32:10.940 --> 32:15.180
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

461
32:15.300 --> 32:17.820
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

462
32:17.900 --> 32:21.020
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

463
32:21.140 --> 32:24.220
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

464
32:24.980 --> 32:28.980
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

465
32:29.500 --> 32:32.300
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

466
32:32.340 --> 32:38.580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

467
32:39.220 --> 32:43.020
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

468
32:43.140 --> 32:46.220
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

469
32:46.260 --> 32:50.620
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

470
32:50.620 --> 32:55.140
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

471
33:05.340 --> 33:06.260
Bow!

472
33:06.260 --> 33:09.320
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

473
33:10.500 --> 33:13.340
Long live Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm!

474
33:13.340 --> 33:16.540
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

475
33:36.860 --> 33:39.260
The condemned official Yan Shang.

476
33:45.700 --> 33:48.460
Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm, issues a decree.

477
33:48.780 --> 33:51.140
Condemned official Yan Shang, receive the decree!

478
33:52.220 --> 33:53.180
Princess Danyang,

479
33:54.020 --> 33:55.100
Guardian of the Realm?

480
33:55.980 --> 33:56.380
That's right.

481
33:57.900 --> 33:58.780
You haven't heard?

482
33:59.700 --> 34:02.420
She's been ruling as regent for days now.

483
34:02.420 --> 34:06.440
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

484
34:06.440 --> 34:10.460
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

485
34:12.980 --> 34:13.460
I

486
34:14.820 --> 34:15.460
receive the decree.

487
34:16.300 --> 34:21.380
By imperial decree, Collator Yan Shang was sent on a southern inspection.

488
34:22.140 --> 34:23.980
Though his intentions were to save the people,

489
34:24.140 --> 34:26.460
he overstepped by seizing military authority.

490
34:26.460 --> 34:27.820
His merits offset his faults.

491
34:27.980 --> 34:29.300
Yet the law cannot forgive.

492
34:29.820 --> 34:31.020
He's hereby appointed Magistrate of Lanyang.

493
34:31.340 --> 34:33.060
He shall not enter court without an imperial summons.

494
34:33.500 --> 34:35.140
Let it be carried out.

495
34:35.140 --> 34:38.420
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

496
34:38.420 --> 34:38.980
Thank you,

497
34:40.660 --> 34:43.180
Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm.

498
34:44.900 --> 34:48.900
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

499
34:49.140 --> 34:53.700
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

500
34:54.460 --> 34:58.500
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

501
34:59.060 --> 35:03.900
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

502
35:04.100 --> 35:07.820
♪I'll take the open road and journey home♪

503
35:08.540 --> 35:10.800
(Imperial Prison) ♪With rosy clouds,♪

504
35:10.800 --> 35:13.340
(Imperial Prison) ♪I bid the moon goodnight♪

505
35:13.980 --> 35:17.660
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

506
35:23.740 --> 35:26.860
(Imperial Prison)

507
35:37.700 --> 35:41.340
♪Through thick fog, the road stretches on♪

508
35:41.860 --> 35:46.700
♪I've endured every hardship and pain♪

509
35:47.220 --> 35:50.940
♪Like burning wood, I offer up my flame♪ (Imperial Prison)

510
35:51.460 --> 35:55.540
♪As rain pours down over a thousand rivers♪

511
36:00.180 --> 36:04.860
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

512
36:05.140 --> 36:09.300
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

513
36:10.340 --> 36:10.620
Shang.

514
36:10.620 --> 36:13.900
♪Frost on my shoulders, joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

515
36:13.900 --> 36:14.580
Wenji.

516
36:14.820 --> 36:18.580
♪A thousand miles of lights keep me company♪

517
36:19.380 --> 36:24.140
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

518
36:26.100 --> 36:28.260
I've prepared a carriage and clean clothes for you.

519
36:28.820 --> 36:29.460
Let me see you off.

520
36:29.460 --> 36:33.740
♪Tread the boundless clouds and rise with the wind♪

521
36:34.340 --> 36:39.340
♪March to the gates with fearless hearts♪

522
36:39.420 --> 36:44.460
♪Break every gate♪

523
36:47.180 --> 36:48.900
(Release of 200,000 dan of grain from the three Jiannan granaries authorized.)

524
36:52.700 --> 36:53.220
Cailian.

525
36:55.020 --> 36:55.700
What time is it?

526
36:55.980 --> 36:57.620
Your Highness, it's almost the Chen hour.

527
37:06.340 --> 37:10.340
(Supervise the repair of the Dujiangyan branch canals and wells.)

528
37:13.060 --> 37:16.540
(Tax exemption for one year.)

529
37:20.940 --> 37:25.820
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

530
37:27.980 --> 37:33.340
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

531
37:35.420 --> 37:41.540
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

532
37:41.660 --> 37:47.380
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

533
37:48.300 --> 37:49.580
(Guanghua Gate)

534
37:49.580 --> 37:50.060
Sir.

535
37:50.900 --> 37:52.940
There's a young lady up on the city wall.

536
37:53.900 --> 37:55.700
(Guanghua Gate) No idea who she is.

537
37:56.100 --> 37:57.060
She's watching us.

538
38:03.020 --> 38:03.500
(Yan Shang.)

539
38:04.340 --> 38:05.060
(Don't come down.)

540
38:06.140 --> 38:08.100
(If you look at me and beg,)

541
38:09.300 --> 38:10.700
(I might actually give in.)

542
38:12.620 --> 38:13.700
(I don't want to change my mind.)

543
38:17.180 --> 38:21.900
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

544
38:21.980 --> 38:23.820
♪Not a single hour less♪

545
38:23.900 --> 38:27.540
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

546
38:27.540 --> 38:31.580
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

547
38:33.180 --> 38:33.700
Sir.

548
38:35.420 --> 38:36.380
What does that young lady

549
38:37.620 --> 38:38.380
look like?

550
38:39.380 --> 38:40.660
There's someone holding

551
38:41.220 --> 38:43.540
a grand canopy over her.

552
38:44.780 --> 38:45.740
Quite a sight.

553
38:48.540 --> 38:50.020
She must be here to see you off.

554
39:01.940 --> 39:02.460
Let's go.

555
39:05.540 --> 39:06.820
If she's here to see you off,

556
39:06.980 --> 39:08.260
why not go see her?

557
39:09.740 --> 39:10.700
It's a long journey.

558
39:11.420 --> 39:13.060
You may never get another chance.

559
39:23.660 --> 39:24.100
Just go.

560
39:24.100 --> 39:27.620
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing across your brow♪

561
39:29.820 --> 39:31.000
(Guanghua Gate)

562
39:31.000 --> 39:35.140
♪Let me hold you whenever the rain falls♪

563
39:35.340 --> 39:39.300
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies - Together we'll turn to ashes♪

564
39:39.300 --> 39:41.466
♪Burning bright as a song♪

565
39:41.466 --> 39:45.180
♪- Two shadows entwined - A beautiful sight♪

566
39:45.180 --> 39:50.100
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪ (Peace Throughout the Realm)

567
39:50.380 --> 39:55.020
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

568
39:55.100 --> 39:56.940
♪Not a single hour less♪

569
39:57.020 --> 40:00.980
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

570
40:00.980 --> 40:04.740
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

571
40:04.860 --> 40:08.180
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

572
40:08.300 --> 40:11.820
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

573
40:12.100 --> 40:18.900
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

574
40:19.100 --> 40:20.980
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

575
40:20.980 --> 40:23.620
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn - May time be free of pain♪

576
40:23.660 --> 40:26.220
♪You're the only one I need♪ (Guanghua Gate)

577
40:26.260 --> 40:29.900
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

578
40:29.900 --> 40:33.420
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

579
40:33.460 --> 40:36.860
♪- Be my one and only in this world - Be my one and only in this life♪

580
40:36.860 --> 40:40.340
♪My last untouched innocence♪

581
40:40.800 --> 40:43.420
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

582
40:43.420 --> 40:44.100
(Yan Shang.)

583
40:45.700 --> 40:46.700
(You make me feel like)

584
40:47.780 --> 40:48.780
(no one in this world)

585
40:50.940 --> 40:52.260
(loves anyone.)

586
40:55.300 --> 40:55.940
(Mu Wanyao,)

587
40:57.260 --> 40:58.300
(you should be smiling.)

588
40:59.580 --> 41:01.260
(This is the punishment he deserves.)

589
41:02.260 --> 41:03.820
(All your enemies are gone.)

590
41:04.580 --> 41:05.940
(You've gotten what you wanted.)

591
41:07.740 --> 41:09.020
(In the past,)

592
41:09.900 --> 41:11.420
(wouldn't the thought of this day)

593
41:12.100 --> 41:13.620
(have made you laugh with joy?)

594
41:26.340 --> 41:27.540
Paths

595
41:29.340 --> 41:31.060
must part in the end.

596
41:36.780 --> 41:37.940
Sheng'an

597
41:40.900 --> 41:44.660
was but a dream.

598
41:50.500 --> 41:53.860
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

599
41:53.980 --> 41:57.460
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

600
41:57.700 --> 42:04.540
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

601
42:04.780 --> 42:06.660
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

602
42:06.660 --> 42:09.300
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn - May time be free of pain♪

603
42:09.380 --> 42:11.900
♪You're the only one I need♪

604
42:11.940 --> 42:15.540
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

605
42:15.540 --> 42:19.100
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

606
42:19.220 --> 42:22.540
♪- Be my one and only in this world - Be my one and only in this life♪

607
42:22.580 --> 42:26.020
♪My last untouched innocence♪

608
42:35.820 --> 42:36.420
Sir!

609
42:37.060 --> 42:38.020
We've arrived in Lanyang.

610
42:40.700 --> 42:41.260
Mr. Han.

611
42:42.020 --> 42:42.900
Thanks for the long journey.

612
42:45.940 --> 42:49.700
(Lanyang)

613
42:57.260 --> 42:59.660
Please. Just a sip for the child.

614
42:59.780 --> 43:00.740
Who knows?

615
43:01.500 --> 43:02.660
Bad man! Bad man!

616
43:02.660 --> 43:03.180
Hit him!

617
43:03.540 --> 43:04.140
Hit him!

618
43:06.620 --> 43:07.420
Pelt him!

619
43:07.860 --> 43:08.940
Whose brats are these?

620
43:08.940 --> 43:09.700
Bad man! Bad man!

621
43:09.700 --> 43:10.780
Where'd you little brats come from?

622
43:11.540 --> 43:12.340
So ill-mannered!

623
43:13.740 --> 43:15.620
You ill-bred little hooligans!

624
43:18.020 --> 43:19.020
Thief!

625
43:19.220 --> 43:20.180
Catch the thief!

626
43:20.180 --> 43:21.260
You've been robbed.

627
43:21.900 --> 43:23.540
You starving beasts!

628
43:24.100 --> 43:24.700
Stop running!

629
43:26.860 --> 43:27.380
Robber!

630
43:27.780 --> 43:29.020
You robber!

631
43:32.260 --> 43:32.940
Sir.

632
43:33.620 --> 43:36.780
This place is crawling with robbers.

633
43:37.860 --> 43:39.820
Why aren't you worried?

634
43:40.020 --> 43:42.380
You don't even have a blanket left.

635
43:43.860 --> 43:45.180
No blanket to sleep under!

636
43:45.180 --> 43:46.540
Serves you right!

637
43:46.540 --> 43:46.900
You...

638
43:47.620 --> 43:49.180
- Sleeping on the street! - How dare you be so rude!

639
43:50.180 --> 43:51.060
The man in this carriage

640
43:51.580 --> 43:53.980
is the new magistrate of Lanyang!

641
43:54.900 --> 43:56.140
Another corrupt official?

642
43:56.140 --> 43:56.980
You rabble!

643
43:56.980 --> 43:57.420
Mr. Han.

644
43:57.420 --> 43:58.820
Probably here to make our lives hell.

645
44:00.420 --> 44:01.300
Skip the County Office for now.

646
44:01.900 --> 44:02.660
Keep going.

647
44:03.380 --> 44:03.900
Please

648
44:04.460 --> 44:06.060
take me around the city of Lanyang.

649
44:08.620 --> 44:11.260
This posting of yours is no good thing.

650
44:11.860 --> 44:12.700
These people

651
44:12.860 --> 44:13.340
are really...

652
44:14.460 --> 44:17.700
- This place is no land of good folk. - Corrupt official!

653
44:18.420 --> 44:19.660
The corrupt official's leaving!

654
44:19.780 --> 44:20.380
He's gone!

655
44:22.380 --> 44:23.700
The corrupt official's leaving!

656
44:27.220 --> 44:31.940
(Next Episode Preview)

657
44:31.940 --> 44:33.140
Three years as a Prince Consort,

658
44:33.860 --> 44:35.060
and I've nearly forgotten who I am.

659
44:35.940 --> 44:36.700
Where are we?

660
44:37.900 --> 44:38.340
Lanyang.

661
44:48.600 --> 44:51.893
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

662
44:54.578 --> 44:59.494
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

663
45:01.688 --> 45:07.533
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

664
45:08.033 --> 45:13.259
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

665
45:16.028 --> 45:20.819
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

666
45:21.655 --> 45:27.734
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

667
45:29.535 --> 45:32.685
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

668
45:32.685 --> 45:34.333
♪Burning bright as a song♪

669
45:34.385 --> 45:38.109
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

670
45:38.487 --> 45:43.153
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

671
45:43.772 --> 45:47.813
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

672
45:48.304 --> 45:50.419
♪Not a single hour less♪

673
45:50.459 --> 45:57.405
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

674
45:58.168 --> 46:01.621
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

675
46:01.801 --> 46:04.946
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

676
46:05.385 --> 46:12.022
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

677
46:12.419 --> 46:14.457
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

678
46:14.457 --> 46:16.933
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

679
46:16.971 --> 46:19.440
♪You're the only one I need♪

680
46:19.644 --> 46:26.531
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

681
46:26.843 --> 46:30.114
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

682
46:30.419 --> 46:33.592
♪My last untouched innocence♪

683
46:33.916 --> 46:37.342
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

684
46:37.575 --> 46:40.800
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

685
46:41.131 --> 46:47.927
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

686
46:48.296 --> 46:50.358
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

687
46:50.359 --> 46:52.862
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

688
46:52.909 --> 46:55.247
♪You're the only one I need♪

689
46:55.478 --> 47:02.313
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

690
47:02.662 --> 47:04.280
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

691
47:04.410 --> 47:06.206
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

692
47:06.563 --> 47:09.580
♪You're the only one I need♪

693
47:09.620 --> 47:10.947
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)

694
47:10.947 --> 47:11.947
kissasia.biz
